#: windows.cpp:112
msgid "Focus policy"
msgstr "fokus beleid"

#: windows.cpp:124
msgid "Click to focus"
msgstr "kliek aan fokus"

#: windows.cpp:125
msgid "Focus follows mouse"
msgstr "fokus volg muis"

#: windows.cpp:126
msgid "Focus under mouse"
msgstr "fokus onder muis"

#: windows.cpp:127
msgid "Focus strictly under mouse"
msgstr "fokus streng onder muis"

#: windows.cpp:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The focus policy is used to determine the active window, i.e. the window you "
"can work in. "
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Click to focus:</em>"
" A window becomes active when you click into it. This is the behavior you "
"might know from other operating systems.</li> "
"<li><em>Focus follows mouse:</em> Moving the mouse pointer actively on to a "
"normal window activates it. Very practical if you are using the mouse a "
"lot.</li> "
"<li><em>Focus under mouse:</em> The window that happens to be under the "
"mouse pointer becomes active. If the mouse points nowhere, the last window "
"that was under the mouse has focus. </li> "
"<li><em>Focus strictly under mouse:</em> This is even worse than 'Focus "
"under mouse'. Only the window under the mouse pointer is active. If the "
"mouse points nowhere, nothing has focus. </ul>"
" Note that 'Focus under mouse' and 'Focus strictly under mouse' are not "
"particularly useful. They are only provided for old-fashioned die-hard UNIX "
"people ;-)"
msgstr ""
"die fokus beleid is gebruik word aan bepaal die aktief venster, i.e. die "
"venster jy kan werk in. "
"<ul> "
"<li><em>kliek aan fokus:</em> 'n venster word aktief wanneer jy kliek "
"binnein dit. hierdie is die gedrag jy dalk ken van ander operating "
"sisteme.</li> "
"<li><em>fokus volg muis:</em>"
" beweeg die muis wyser aktief op aan 'n normale venster aktiveer dit. baie "
"prakties as jy word te gebruik die muis 'n baie.</li> "
"<li><em>fokus onder muis:</em> die venster wat gebeur aan wees onder die "
"muis wyser word aktief. as die muis punte nerens, die laaste venster wat was "
"onder die muis het fokus. </li> "
"<li><em>fokus streng onder muis:</em> hierdie is al slegter as 'fokus onder "
"muis'. slegs die venster onder die muis wyser is aktief. as die muis punte "
"nerens, niks het fokus.  </ul> nota wat 'fokus onder muis' en 'fokus streng "
"onder muis' word nie in besonder bruikbare. hulle word slegs verskaf vir "
"old-fashioned die-hard unix mense ;-)"

#: windows.cpp:154
msgid "Auto Raise"
msgstr "outo lig"

#: windows.cpp:158
msgid "Click Raise"
msgstr "kliek lig"

#: windows.cpp:163 windows.cpp:440
msgid "Delay (ms)"
msgstr "vertraging (mev)"

#: windows.cpp:175
msgid ""
"If Auto Raise is enabled, a window in the background will automatically come "
"to the front when the mouse pointer has been over it for some time."
msgstr ""
"as outo lig is geaktiveer, 'n venster in die agtergrond sal automaties kom "
"aan die voor wanneer die muis wyser het al bo dit vir sommige tyd."

#: windows.cpp:177
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window that the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically come to the front."
msgstr ""
"hierdie is die vertraging na wat die venster wat die muis wyser is bo sal "
"automaties kom aan die voor."

#: windows.cpp:183
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, your windows will be brought to the front when "
"you click somewhere into the window contents."
msgstr ""
"wanneer hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, jou vensters sal wees bring aan die "
"voor wanneer jy kliek êrens binnein die venster inhoud."

#: windows.cpp:188
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "sleutelbord"

#: windows.cpp:193
msgid "Walk through windows mode:"
msgstr "stap deur vensters modus:"

#: windows.cpp:195
msgid "KDE"
msgstr "kde"

#: windows.cpp:197
msgid "CDE"
msgstr "cde"

#: windows.cpp:200
msgid ""
"Keep the Alt key pressed and hit the Tab key repeatedly to walk through the "
"windows on the current desktop (the Alt+Tab combination can be "
"reconfigured). The two different modes mean:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>KDE</b>: a nice widget is shown, displaying the icons of all windows "
"to walk through and the title of the currently selected one;"
"<li><b>CDE</b>"
": the focus is passed to a new window each time Tab is hit. No fancy "
"widget.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"hou die alt sleutel gedruk en getref die oortjie sleutel herhaaldelik aan "
"stap deur die vensters op die huidige werkskerm (die alt+oortjie kombinasie "
"kan wees geherkonfigureer). die twee ander modusse "
"beteken:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>kde</b>: 'n oulike gui-element is vertoon, vertooning die ikoone van "
"alle vensters aan stap deur en die titel van die huidiglik gekose "
"een;"
"<li><b>cde</b>: die fokus is aanstuur aan 'n nuwe venster elke tyd oortjie "
"is getref. nee deftige gui-element.</li></ul>"

#: windows.cpp:211
msgid "Traverse windows on all desktops"
msgstr "versprei vensters op alle werkskerms"

#: windows.cpp:215
msgid ""
"Leave this option disabled if you want to limit walking through windows to "
"the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"los hierdie opsie gestremde as jy wil hê aan beperk stap deur vensters aan "
"die huidige werkskerm."

#: windows.cpp:424
msgid "Shading"
msgstr "skadu"

#: windows.cpp:430
msgid "Animate"
msgstr "animeer"

#: windows.cpp:431
msgid ""
"Animate the action of reducing the window to its titlebar (shading) as well "
"as the expansion of a shaded window"
msgstr ""
"animeer die aksie van verminder die venster aan sy titelbar (skadu) as goed "
"as die uitbreiding van 'n gedeel venster"

#: windows.cpp:435
msgid "Enable Hover"
msgstr "aktiveer sweef"

#: windows.cpp:449
msgid ""
"If Shade Hover is enabled, a shaded window will un-shade automatically when "
"the mouse pointer has been over the title bar for some time."
msgstr ""
"as skadu sweef is geaktiveer, 'n gedeel venster sal un-skadu automaties "
"wanneer die muis wyser het al bo die titel kolom vir sommige tyd."

#: windows.cpp:452
msgid ""
"Sets the time in milliseconds before the window unshades when the mouse "
"pointer goes over the shaded window."
msgstr ""
"verstel die tyd in millisekondes voor die venster ontskadu wanneer die muis "
"wyser gaan bo die gedeel venster."

#: windows.cpp:465
msgid "Xinerama"
msgstr "xinerama"

#: windows.cpp:467
msgid "Enable Xinerama Support"
msgstr "aktiveer xinerama ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:468
msgid "Enable support for Xinerama."
msgstr "aktiveer ondersteun vir xinerama."

#: windows.cpp:470
msgid "Enable Window Resistance Support"
msgstr "aktiveer venster weerstand ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:471
msgid ""
"Turn on resistance when moving a window from one physical screen to the "
"other."
msgstr ""
"skakel op weerstand wanneer beweeg 'n venster van een fisiese skerm aan die "
"ander."

#: windows.cpp:472
msgid "Enable Window Placement Support"
msgstr "aktiveer venster plasing ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:473
msgid ""
"This option opens new windows on the physical screen on which the cursor is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"hierdie opsie maak oop nuwe vensters op die fisiese skerm op wat die "
"plekaanduier is voordra."

#: windows.cpp:474
msgid "Enable Window Maximize Support"
msgstr "aktiveer venster maksimeer ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:475
msgid ""
"When this option is turned on, windows will only maximize up to the physical "
"screen size."
msgstr ""
"wanneer hierdie opsie is geskakel op, vensters sal slegs maksimeer begin aan "
"die fisiese skerm grootte."

#: windows.cpp:480
msgid "Active Desktop Borders"
msgstr "aktief werkskerm grense"

#: windows.cpp:483
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, moving the mouse to a screen border will change "
"your desktop. This is e.g. useful if you want to drag windows from one "
"desktop to the other."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, beweeg die muis aan 'n skerm grens sal "
"verander jou werkskerm. hierdie is e.g. bruikbare as jy wil hê aan trek "
"vensters van een werkskerm aan die ander."

#: windows.cpp:486
msgid "&Disabled"
msgstr "gestremde"

#: windows.cpp:487
msgid "Only when &moving windows"
msgstr "slegs wanneer beweeg vensters"

#: windows.cpp:488
msgid "&Always enabled"
msgstr "altyd geaktiveer"

#: windows.cpp:492
msgid "ms."
msgstr "mev."

#: windows.cpp:493
msgid "Desktop &switch delay:"
msgstr "werkskerm wissel vertraging:"

#: windows.cpp:494
msgid ""
"Here you can set a delay for switching desktops using the active borders "
"feature. Desktops will be switched after the mouse has been pushed against a "
"screen border for the specified number of milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:663
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "vensters"

#: windows.cpp:672
msgid "Display content in moving windows"
msgstr "vertoon inhoud in beweeg vensters"

#: windows.cpp:674
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be fully shown while "
"moving it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not "
"be satisfying on slow machines without graphic acceleration."
msgstr ""
"aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n venster se inhoud aan wees volledig "
"vertoon terwyl beweeg dit, in plaas van van net te wys 'n venster "
"'skeleton'. die resultaat dalk mag nie wees bevredigend op stadige masjiene "
"sonder om te grafiek versnelling."

#: windows.cpp:678
msgid "Display content in resizing windows"
msgstr "vertoon inhoud in hervergrooting vensters"

#: windows.cpp:680
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be shown while resizing "
"it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not be "
"satisfying on slow machines."
msgstr ""
"aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n venster se inhoud aan wees vertoon "
"terwyl hervergrooting dit, in plaas van van net te wys 'n venster "
"'skeleton'. die resultaat dalk mag nie wees bevredigend op stadige masjiene."

#: windows.cpp:689
msgid "Animate Minimize and Restore"
msgstr "animeer minimeer en herstel"

#: windows.cpp:691
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want an animation shown when windows are minimized "
"or restored."
msgstr ""
"aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n animasie vertoon wanneer vensters "
"word geminimeer of gerestoreer."

#: windows.cpp:705
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "stadige"

#: windows.cpp:709
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "vinnige"

#: windows.cpp:713
msgid ""
"Here you can set the speed of the animation shown when windows are minimized "
"and restored. "
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan stel die spoed van die animasie vertoon wanneer vensters word "
"geminimeer en gerestoreer. "

#: windows.cpp:719
msgid "Allow Moving and Resizing of maximized windows"
msgstr "toelaat beweeg en hervergrooting van maksimeerd vensters"

#: windows.cpp:721
msgid ""
"When enabled, this feature activates the border of maximized windows and "
"allows you to move or resize them, just like for normal windows"
msgstr ""
"wanneer geaktiveer, hierdie funksie aktiveer die grens van maksimeerd "
"vensters en laat toe jy aan beweeg of hervergroot hulle, net hou van vir "
"normale vensters"

#: windows.cpp:731
msgid "Placement:"
msgstr "plasing:"

#: windows.cpp:734
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "luukse"

#: windows.cpp:735
msgid "Cascade"
msgstr "kaskade"

#: windows.cpp:736
msgid "Random"
msgstr "lukrake"

#: windows.cpp:743
msgid ""
"The placement policy determines where a new window will appear on the "
"desktop. For now, there are three different policies: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Smart</em> will try to achieve a minimum overlap of windows</li> "
"<li><em>Cascade</em> will cascade the windows</li> "
"<li><em>Random</em> will use a random position</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"die plasing beleid bepaal waar 'n nuwe venster sal verskyn op die werkskerm. "
"vir nou, daar word drie ander beleid: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>luukse</em> sal probeer aan bereik 'n minimum oorvleuel van "
"vensters</li> "
"<li><em>kaskade</em> sal kaskade die vensters</li> "
"<li><em>lukrake</em> sal gebruik 'n lukrake posisie</li></ul>"

#: windows.cpp:775
msgid "Snap Zones"
msgstr "spring sones"

#: windows.cpp:779 windows.cpp:789
msgid "none"
msgstr "geen"

#: windows.cpp:781
msgid "&Border snap zone:"
msgstr "grens spring sone:"

#: windows.cpp:782 windows.cpp:792
msgid " pixels"
msgstr " beeld elemente"

#: windows.cpp:784
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for screen borders, i.e. the 'strength' of "
"the magnetic field which will make windows snap to the border when moved "
"near it."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan stel die spring sone vir skerm grense, i.e. die 'strength' van "
"die magneties veld wat sal maak vensters spring aan die grens wanneer "
"verskuif naby dit."

#: windows.cpp:791
msgid "&Window snap zone:"
msgstr "venster spring sone:"

#: windows.cpp:794
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for windows, i.e. the 'strength' of the "
"magnetic field which will make windows snap to each other when they're moved "
"near another window."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:798
msgid "Snap windows only when &overlapping"
msgstr "spring vensters slegs wanneer oorvleuel"

#: windows.cpp:799
msgid ""
"Here you can set that windows will be only snapped if you try to overlap "
"them, i.e. they won't be snapped if the windows comes only near another "
"window or border."
msgstr ""
